``None`` to reduce over all dimensions.

The standard deviation (:math:`\sigma`) is calculated as

.. math:: \sigma = \sqrt{\frac{1}{\max(0,~N - \delta N)}\sum_{i=0}^{N-1}(x_i-\bar{x})^2}

